# size 20x4
# Insert mode: CSI 4 h, then a character pushes the rest of the row right.
#
# Everything on this machine sends only the sequence that switches it off, which is a no-op on a
# terminal that never had it on - so this case is the one that says what happens if a program
# switches it on. The second line leaves it off again and overwrites instead, which is the
# difference being measured.
abcdef\e[5D\e[4hXY
\r\nabcdef\e[5D\e[4lXY
